OL,3,GNEWSAStroke patients face 45-mile      
OL,4,Ajourney as service changes approved    
OL,6,FPeople could have to travel more than  
OL,7,F45 miles (72km) for treatment following
OL,8,Fa stroke after a health board approved 
OL,9,Fplans to replace four stroke wards with
OL,10,Fone specialist centre.                 
OL,12,FHywel Dda, which covers parts of west  
OL,13,Fand mid Wales, has approved in         
OL,14,Fprinciple controversial changes to the 
OL,15,Fway it delivers stroke services.       
OL,17,FThere had been significant opposition  
OL,18,Fto the proposals, with more than       
OL,19,Ftwo-thirds of respondents in a second  
OL,20,Fconsultation saying they disagreed with
OL,21,Fthe plan.                              
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
