OL,3,GNEWSAStroke patients face 45-mile      
OL,4,Ajourney as service changes approved    
OL,6,FBut the health board said its current  
OL,7,Fstroke services were fragile and did   
OL,8,Fnot meet clinical standards, and that  
OL,9,Fthe change would improve outcomes for  
OL,10,Fpatients.                              
